<deviceset name="WE-MK_0603" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:14284517/13" prefix="L">
<description>WE-MK Multilayer Ceramic SMT Inductor

Characteristics
Coil integrated in a multilayer ceramic structure
All inductors with polarity marking (excepting 0805 size)
High self resonant frequency
Inductive tolerances of ±2% (or ±0.1nH) and ±5% (or ±0.3nH)
Inductance very stable over temperature
Recommended solder profile: Reflow
Operating temperature: –55°C to +125°C

Applications
High frequency circuits
Bluetooth
Wireless LAN
Filter circuits
Oscillators
Pagers
Laptops
PCMCIA-cards

Details see: www.we-online.com/components/products/WE-MK

Updated by Ella 2022-07-21
2022 (C) Würth Elektronik</description>
